(7476624, 1188330, 86447, '<td valign="top">I love this in black and white.<br/> <br/>I think that the boat needs to be much more sharply in focus to make this a high-scoring image.<br/> <br/>But... I see that it''s overly sharpened in post-processing.<br/> <br/>The focus needed to have been on the boat while taking the image, I think.</td>', 'I love this in black and white. I think that the boat needs to be much more sharply in focus to make this a high-scoring image. But... I see that it''s overly sharpened in post-processing. The focus needed to have been on the boat while taking the image, I think.', '2016-10-02 18:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
