(7477494, 1188325, 172697, '<td valign="top">Love the spinning, everything is so dynamic.<br/> <br/>Very clever use of the fisheye, it gives a lot of space and lets the observer focus on the movement.<br/> <br/>Congrats on the HM!</td>', 'Love the spinning, everything is so dynamic. Very clever use of the fisheye, it gives a lot of space and lets the observer focus on the movement. Congrats on the HM!', '2016-10-07 05:48:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(7477495, 1188345, 172697, '<td valign="top">I was uncertain about this picture.<br/> <br/>The trails are SO perfect that the train looks like a wall, stealing a bit of the "speedy" feeling this should have been.<br/> <br/>Very good picture, nonetheless.<br/> <br/>Congrats on the HM!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2016-10-07 10:42:50.</i></td>', 'I was uncertain about this picture. The trails are SO perfect that the train looks like a wall, stealing a bit of the "speedy" feeling this should have been. Very good picture, nonetheless. Congrats on the HM!', '2016-10-07 05:52:42.000000', '2016-10-07 11:42:50.000000', 0),
(7477496, 1188034, 172697, '<td valign="top">I thought this would have been my direct competitor.<br/> <br/>This was my first idea, but I had no sports car to use, unfortunately, so I stayed on topic and used a motorcycle.<br/> <br/>I love how still the inside of the car looks, makes the trails look more "fast" and gives an overall speedy feeling to the picture.<br/> <br/>Great photo.</td>', 'I thought this would have been my direct competitor. This was my first idea, but I had no sports car to use, unfortunately, so I stayed on topic and used a motorcycle. I love how still the inside of the car looks, makes the trails look more "fast" and gives an overall speedy feeling to the picture. Great photo.', '2016-10-07 05:56:47.000000', NULL, 0),
