(7477912, 1188345, 102315, '<td valign="top">Very vibrant and colorful image. I wondered what it would look like if you cropped out all the people leaving only the person waiting on the train to stop so I held a piece of paper on my screen to simulate the crop. Doing that makes it a second image that is just as powerful and could stand on it''s on. <br/> <br/>Great capture and edit.</td>', 'Very vibrant and colorful image. I wondered what it would look like if you cropped out all the people leaving only the person waiting on the train to stop so I held a piece of paper on my screen to simulate the crop. Doing that makes it a second image that is just as powerful and could stand on it''s on.  Great capture and edit.', '2016-10-09 21:07:38.000000', NULL, 0),
